;Cholestenone restraints are based on PDB entry 2X5W and were optimized on the prodrg server. Solvent atoms were added based on peaks in the Fo-Fc map. Non-crystallographic symmetry in the peak positions was considered in the rejection and addition of some sites. Solvent atoms were not included in refinement and structure factor calculation. Some of the assigned water positions likely represent other molecule/atom/ion types. REFMAC, Phenix, coot, and the molprobity server were also used.
